			; <i><span class="en">Tac.
				Agr. 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 3, 28</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">seminecum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					4, 164</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6,
		11</span></i>.</div>
